### US-008: Harden pairing flows for QR approval + static token + addr
Status: in_progress
Depends on: None

Description:
As a user, I want both QR pairing (with approval) and static token + addr login to work reliably with clear errors.

Acceptance Criteria:
- [ ] QR pairing flow validates expiry, requires approval, and stores the device-bound token on success
- [ ] Manual login accepts static token + addr without requiring desktop approval when token is valid
- [ ] Example: scan QR, approve on desktop, and reconnect later using stored token without re-approval
- [ ] Negative case: expired QR shows an explicit error and prompts to generate a new code


